<title>USA: International Remote sees Q4 sales $6.3 mln.</title>
<headline>International Remote sees Q4 sales $6.3 mln.</headline>
<dateline>CHATSWORTH, Calif. 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>International Remote Imaging Systems Inc said Friday it expects breakeven fourth-quarter operating earnings before interest, taxes, depreciation and amortization (EBITDA), excluding one-time expenses connected with its previously announced restructuring and recently completed arbitration with TOA Medical Electronics.</p>
<p>The company disclosed that fourth-quarter sales were $6.3 million and said it expects to release its 1996 audited results later this month.</p>
